WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:01.963
- I filled in for you when you were gone.

00:00:01.963 --> 00:00:04.430
- And you almost did too well, Kelly.

00:00:04.430 --> 00:00:06.150
- Oh, whatever, I felt nervous.

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:08.817
I was like, who fills in
for fricking Simon Cowell?

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:11.260
- Well I gotta hand it
to you, because you know,

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:14.720
we were a bit of a loose end
and someone said, you know

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:16.160
do you think Kelly would do it?

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:19.980
I said, I promise you if
Kelly's free, she'll do it.

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:22.100
And I was watching
literally in bed that night.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.730
And I'm thinking, thank you.

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:24.670
And as I'm watching it,

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:27.520
I'm thinking you're
actually doing too well here

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:29.643
- You're dumb.
- That's true.

00:00:29.643 --> 00:00:31.819
I did not, I will tell you this though,

00:00:31.819 --> 00:00:34.670
I did put on a little British
accent for this little thing.

00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:35.690
- I'd like to hear that again, please.

00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:37.653
- Would you you like to
see it? Yes, it's great.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:40.400
I don't like it.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:41.590
I love it.

00:00:41.590 --> 00:00:44.540
Except I need glasses and a black shirt,

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:45.540
but I'm missing that.

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:47.330
And then wait, there's another one.

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:51.250
It's what the bloody hell was that?

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:55.170
I have the worst British
accent in the entire universe.

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:56.730
I don't do accents.

00:00:56.730 --> 00:00:58.798
That was dreadful.
It was dreadful.

00:00:58.798 --> 00:01:01.840
(laughing and clapping)
Let me do one in return,

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:02.860
let me try and do an American,

00:01:02.860 --> 00:01:04.134
give me something American to say.

00:01:04.134 --> 00:01:05.360
I can give you Texan.
- Okay, I'll do Texan.

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:07.410
- How y'all doing?
- How y'all doing?

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:09.240
- Nope. (laughing)

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:11.860
- How y'all doing, I
think I want a barbecue.

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:14.769
- Nope, where are you from, the Bayou?

00:01:14.769 --> 00:01:17.710
- Yeah I'd like a barbecue,
I'd like some ribs.

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:20.160
- Okay, you're about as
good as my accent, Simon.

